#. module: eh_account_fx_revaluation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_fx_revaluation.field_eh_fx_hedge_test__slope
msgid ""
"Slope of the regression of hedged-item change on hedging-instrument change. "
"An effective hedge offsets the hedged item, so the slope must be negative "
"and close to -1 (its absolute value within 0.80 to 1.25). R-squared alone is"
" sign-blind, so the slope guards against a positively correlated, non-"
"hedging relationship."
msgstr ""
"被套期项目变动对套期工具变动的回归斜率。有效的套期会抵消被套期项目，因此斜率必须为负且接近 -1（其绝对值在 0.80 至 1.25 "
"之间）。R-squared 本身无法识别符号，因此斜率可防范正相关的非套期关系。"

